Frameworks for StretchRes
========================

This directory contains third-party frameworks required by the StretchRes tweak.

Frameworks referenced:
- UIKit: The primary framework for iOS UI development. All UI components 
  in the preference bundle (PSGroupHeader, PSLabel, PSButton, PSNumberTextField, 
  PSToggleSwitch, PSRadioButton) are from UIKit. Headers are provided by Theos.
- Foundation: Core framework for NSUserDefaults, NSFileManager, NSDictionary, 
  NSString, and other fundamental classes. Provided by Theos.

No additional third-party frameworks are required. The tweak avoids unnecessary 
dependencies and stays compatible with iOS 15.0–15.8.8.

Files in this directory:
- UIKit headers (provided by Theos)
- Foundation headers (provided by Theos)